robably best known for playing the titular serial killer on what Showtime drama that ran from 2006 to 2013?\\n\\nAnswer: Dexter - What Will Wright created video game series released in 2000 (with sequels in 2004, 2009, and 2014) saw players watching and directing characters to mundane ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/2000s-pop-culture-trivia\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d69\"},\"ref\":\"d69\",\"snippet\":\" ... On top of that, he's very over-the-top and cheesy, and as such, the actors have parodied that character in the comedy portions of later entries in the series. The actor who played, him, though, has returned for the 3rd, 5th, 6th, and 8th entries, as ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PlotIrrelevantVillain\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d70\"},\"ref\":\"d70\",\"snippet\":\" ... 26, 2024, their stepmother, Joan Ciccone, died after \\\"a brief encounter with a very aggressive cancer.\\\"\\n\\nJohn Amos\\n\\nJohn Amos, best known for playing James Evans Sr. on \\\"Good Times,\\\" died at age 84.\\n\\nThe actor's son, Kelly Christopher Amos, announced that his father passed away on ... \",\"title\":\"https://pagesix.com/celebrity-news/celebrity-deaths-2024/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"72cac75b3fcd7d941ba95f8c05172095523e425b8272ae0a94390d6152dde4bd\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e09322242237d5f61f31cf5945264b2a31293df0d8a02959a7d51a06d0f4e110\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor plays with real life daughter son unrelated character series\",\"view\":\"full\"},{