:{\"ref\":\"d56\"},\"ref\":\"d56\",\"snippet\":\" ... CC\\n\\nRead the review\\n\\n40\\n\\nUnrelated (2007)\\n\\nAt the age of 47, after a career directing TV soaps such as Casualty and EastEnders, Joanna Hogg reinvented herself as auteur of a new breed of cinema. In her feature debut, Unrelated, Kathryn Worth played a fortyish woman holidaying in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2019/sep/13/100-best-films-movies-of-the-21st-century\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"7b8b0f8f7c25d15406a6fa6f8fbd38cc8efa17b962dc96cdfe7a0b178c712830\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"2c1bc744f4716d575f7c22fca93efa692673d4587b565989371680d2beec1270\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV show real life mother daughter play unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_7d48ceff586647318e0e55df"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d72\"},\"ref\":\"d72\",\"snippet\":\" ... Austin's addiction to drugs prescribed for manic depression ultimately caused their separation, and he died from a deliberate overdose the year after their marriage ended. The couple had one daughter, Tracy, born in 1961.\\n\\nIn 1965, Collins married again, this time to American art gallery and nightclub ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackie_Collins\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d73\"},\"ref\":\"d73\",\"snippet\":\" ... They proved to be very successful and they interacted fairly well with the established characters. Nathan Hastings (Nathan Purdee/Randy Brooks/Adam Lazarre-White), the only other remaining black character on the show before 1990, was married off to Olivia, before dying in a hit and run car ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Young_and_the_Restless_storylines\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Aidy Bryant's Hulu series Shrill and in the 2019 film James vs. His Future Self. In 2023, he joined season 4 of Apple TV+'s critically acclaimed science fiction drama For All Mankind as the character Eli Hobson.\\n\\nHe and actress Laure Mattos have been married ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d74\"},\"ref\":\"d74\",\"snippet\":\" ... She immediately won the character role of \\\"Elly May Clampett\\\" on one of the greatest situation comedies of all time, The Beverly Hillbillies (1962). This extremely comical series debuted with The Clampetts Strike Oil (1962), on her 30th birthday, Wednesday, September 26th, 1962, which is among the narrowest ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2015\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d75\"},\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... dies. In the end of the book, Alex proposes to her and she happily accepts. In Cross Fire, both Bree and Alex look forward to their wedding, while at the same time dealing with Kyle Craig. They get married after facing off against Kyle Craig \\\"the Mastermind\\\" one ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alex_Cross\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Every woman who gets involved with Nate Romanowski - the series' resident badass - meets an untimely end.\\n\\n- The Cat Who... Series: Supporting character Iris Cobb was married three times, and all three of her husbands predeceased her — her first one (and the father of her only son) died of ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CartwrightCurse\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d76\"},\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... She was working as a New York fashion model when she married her first husband, four-years-younger Peter Griffith, in 1952 (they divorced in 1960). She gave birth to her only child, future star Melanie Griffith, on August 9, 1957. Alfred Hitchcock discovered Tippi, the pretty cover ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1930-01-01,1930-12-31&gender=female\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... relationship (parts of which are featured in Episode Four of the 2002 television series). In the novel Hélène is abroad with Young Jolyon and June at that time and dies in 1894; in the series she has already died.\\n\\nBosinney's death is the background of the novel ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Forsyte_Saga_(2002_TV_series)\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"fd82b7f00c61135ad6bc9cd489b98bf99aa6ada74d939010457b901e8a4bb698\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"3a69491b486aa94ec27ef4b8b5827cb57997d61d2509f6a1bbbbab64f29c7103\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measur